WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.025
A row holds cols; each col shares the width; a card goes inside a col

2
00:00:05.726 --> 00:00:09.351
A row is Bootstrap's line of columns. It is empty.

3
00:00:09.953 --> 00:00:14.403
A col inside it, and a card inside the col: the shape from the cards.

4
00:00:15.305 --> 00:00:17.480
One col takes the whole row.

5
00:00:18.157 --> 00:00:21.407
A second col, and the two share the row equally.

6
00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:27.715
No Flexbox rules of your own. Row and col did the layout.
